146}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"NUM","chapter":10,"verse":22,"verseEnd":22,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Next, the divisions of the camp of Ephraim set out under their standard, with Elishama son of Ammihud in command.","from":24},{"book":"GEN","chapter":48,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And now your two sons born to you in Egypt before I came to you here shall be reckoned as mine; Ephraim and Manasseh shall be mine, just as Reuben and Simeon are mine.","from":18},{"book":"GEN","chapter":48,"verse":14,"verseEnd":20,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"But Israel stretched out his right hand and put it on the head of Ephraim, the younger; and crossing his hands, he put his left on Manassehʼs head, although Manasseh was the firstborn. Then he blessed Joseph and said: “May the God before whom my fathers Abraham and Isaac walked, the God who has been my shepherd all my life to this day, the angel who has redeemed me from all harm— may He bless these boys. And may they be called by my name and the names of my fathers Abraham and Isaac, and may they grow into a multitude upon the earth.” When Joseph saw that his father had placed his right hand on Ephraimʼs head, he was displeased and took his fatherʼs hand to move it from Ephraimʼs head to Manassehʼs. “Not so, my father!” Joseph said. “This one is the firstborn; put your right hand on his head.”","from":18},{"book":"NUM","chapter":1,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"from the sons of Joseph: from Ephraim, Elishama son of Ammihud, and from Manasseh, Gamaliel son of Pedahzur;","from":18},{"book":"NUM","chapter":1,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"from the sons of Joseph: from Ephraim, Elishama son of Ammihud, and from Manasseh, Gamaliel son of Pedahzur;","from":20},{"book":"NUM","chapter":1,"verse":11,"verseEnd":11,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"from Benjamin, Abidan son of Gideoni;","from":22},{"book":"NUM","chapter":1,"verse":32,"verseEn